  <question type="coderunner">
    <name><text>S10 Q1 — Build a bloom filter</text></name>
    <questiontext format="html">
      <text><![CDATA[<div style="background:#f8fafc;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;border-left:5px solid #f7931a;border-radius:8px;padding:18px 22px;margin-bottom:16px;">
<p style="color:#9a3412;font-family:Georgia,serif;font-size:13px;font-weight:bold;letter-spacing:2px;text-transform:uppercase;margin:0 0 8px;">S10 Q1 — Build a bloom filter</p>
<p style="color:#1e293b;font-family:Georgia,serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.8;margin:0;">A bloom filter is a row of bits; adding an item sets the bits at its hash positions.</p>
</div>
<p style="font-family:Georgia,serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.8;">Write <strong><code>bloom_insert(m, positions)</code></strong> returning a list of <code>m</code> bits (0/1) with every index in <code>positions</code> set to 1.</p>
<div style="background:#fdf4ff;border-left:5px solid #9333ea;border-radius:8px;padding:12px 18px;margin:12px 0;">
<pre style="color:#3b0764;font-family:'Courier New',monospace;font-size:14px;margin:0;background:none;border:none;">bloom_insert(5, [0, 2, 4]) &rarr; [1, 0, 1, 0, 1]</pre>
</div>]]></text>
    </questiontext>
